 "coaching_points": [
  "Warm up 2-3 minutes first \u2014 jog gently, wiggle your ankles, and do easy toe-taps on top of the ball",
  "Keep the ball close \u2014 take lots of little touches so the ball is never more than one step away from your feet",
  "Wiggle through each gate! Steer the ball right through the little doors with the inside of your foot",
  "Look up between gates to find the next door \u2014 eyes off the ball for a peek, then back to your touches",
  "Push the ball and run to speed up after the last gate \u2014 a little burst through the finish door",
  "Target \u2014 get through all 3 gates cleanly on 8 of 10 tries without the ball rolling away",
  "6 runs per set, 3 sets \u2014 after you zoom through the finish gate, jog back to fetch the ball; that jog is your rest",
  "Make it easier \u2014 if the gates feel hard, spread them wider; make it harder \u2014 get 8/10 clean, then slide the gates a step closer together",
  "Bend your knees and land softly on your turns to keep your legs happy"
 ],
 "variations": [
  "Weak foot only \u2014 steer every gate with your other foot",
  "Beat the clock \u2014 count how many seconds the whole run takes and try to go a little faster each time",
  "Silly touches \u2014 do a toe-tap or a roll before each gate for fun"
 ],
